# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Qiskit bosons"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page explains how to install the Python API. A C API is not available for this package yet.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapaliwanag ng page na ito kung paano i-install ang Python API. Wala pang available na C API para sa package na ito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga kinakailangan {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Una, gumawa ng minimal na environment na Python lang ang naka-install. Gumamit ng [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang bago mong environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "May dalawang pangunahing paraan para i-install ang package na ito: mula sa PyPI o mula sa source. Ang inirerekomendang paraan ay mag-install mula sa PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Mag-install mula sa PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Mag-install mula sa source {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Kung plano mong mag-develop sa repository, dapat kang mag-install mula sa source.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-bosons` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Una, dapat naka-install ang Qiskit sa parehong Python environment kung saan mo ini-install ang `qiskit-bosons`. Ang pinakasimpleng paraan ay mula sa PyPI, pero maaari mo ring i-install ang Qiskit mula sa source kung gusto mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-bosons` repository.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-clone ang repository ng `qiskit-bosons`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, i-install ang Rust toolchain, i-upgrade ang pip, at pumasok sa repository. Tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) para sa mga tagubilin sa pag-install ng toolchain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "I-install ang natitirang `build` dependencies. Kung plano mong mag-develop sa repository, i-install ang `dev` dependencies.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-bosons` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Ang susunod na hakbang ay i-install ang `qiskit-bosons` sa virtual environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pahiwatig\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Maaari ka ring gumawa ng editable install habang kino-compile pa rin ang pinagbabatayang Rust crate sa `release` mode:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Ang ilang feature ay umaasa sa mga optional na dependency. Para i-install ang lahat ng mga ito, gamitin ang `all` extra:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Tingnan ang seksyong `[project.optional-dependencies]` ng [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) para makita kung aling mga dependency group ang available.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-bosons` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Maaari mong opsyonal na i-verify kung matagumpay ang pag-install. Ang pinakasimpleng test ay subukang mag-import ng isa sa mga class na ibinibigay ng package na `qiskit-bosons`, tulad ng sa sumusunod na halimbawa:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Kung matagumpay itong natapos, gumana ang pag-install mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Maaari mo ring patakbuhin ang buong Python test suite:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Para patakbuhin din ang mga test na gumagamit ng mga optional na dependency, i-install ang mga extra at gamitin ang `testoptional` target:\n"
